4. Population Consideration: All included studies involve patients with brain tumors and evaluate antiepileptic drug 
prophylaxis, which aligns with the review objective.

5. The 9 included studies represent a mix of:
   - Postoperative seizure prophylaxis (Studies 3, 8, 12, 15, 32)
   - Contrast media-induced seizure prophylaxis (Studies 9, 14)
   - General seizure prophylaxis in newly diagnosed brain tumors (Studies 19, 33)

